  one-hot columns: ['cell_line', 'ligase']
  feature width 2061: 2048 fingerprint (count) + 9 descriptors + 4 indicators
* random split: 241 train / 0 test
* Held-out performance
  no test set; performance unknown
* Wrote experiments/surrogates/protac_pdc50_smarca2/evaluation.pickle

Use it by adding this to the 'oracles' block of a goal_directed config:
  "evaluation": {
      "type": "sklearn",
      "path": "experiments/surrogates/protac_pdc50_smarca2/evaluation.pickle",
      "output": "predict",
      "direction": "maximize"
  }
and naming it in 'score_components'. The featurization is stored in the pickle and the oracle reads it, so there is nothing to keep in sync by hand.
